; Typed names for the closed numeral vocabulary occurring in the pinned
; Popper synthesis snapshot.  This is an exact-image adapter, not a claim
; that Prime arithmetic is finite: arithmetic relations remain separate
; proof-relevant families and must earn their own coverage.

